👨‍💻 Why This Is Important in Real Life
Websites often accidentally leave hidden pages public (e.g., /admin, /config).

Hackers use tools like Gobuster to find these and exploit them.

Penetration testers (ethical hackers) use this skill to help companies find and fix issues.

